Interaction entre l’histoire et les agents pathogènes :
Jonathan Kennedy (2023) : Pathogenesis – A History of the World in Eight Plagues/ How germs made history
 
Yaron Ayalon (2014) : « Natural Disasters in the Ottoman Empire », in « The Black Death and the Rise of the Ottomans » (https://www.cambridge.org/core/books/natural-disasters-in-the-ottoman-empire/black-death-and-the-rise-of-the-ottomans/D83E412C0BB3C092E79683722AFFFC33)
 
